---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Merlin Insights"
	description="The story behind Merlin and the technology driving advanced validation."
	pubDate={new Date('November 14 2025')}
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<p>
		Welcome to Merlin Insights, a dedicated research hub exploring the frontier of 
		AI-powered security and identity validation. We're driven by the mission to 
		cleanse the digital world of friction and fraud through intelligent engineering.
	</p>

	<section class="about-grid">
		<div class="card glass">
			<h3>The Vision</h3>
			<p>
				My goal is to bridge the gap between complex engineering and intuitive design. 
				In a world increasingly driven by code, I believe the details matter more than ever.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="card glass">
			<h3>The Stack</h3>
			<p>
				I specialize in modern web ecosystems, primarily focusing on advanced frontend 
				architectures, TypeScript, and cloud-native standards. I'm always exploring 
				new ways to optimize performance and user experience.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<h2>The Philosophy</h2>
	<p>
		Every line of code is an opportunity to solve a problem or spark joy. I strive for 
		simplicity in architecture and richness in aesthetics. Whether it's a small internal 
		tool or a large-scale consumer application, the principles remain the same: 
		clarity, performance, and accessibility.
	</p>

	<blockquote>
		"Design is not just what it looks like and feels like. Design is how it works."
	</blockquote>

	<p>
		When I'm not coding, you can find me exploring the latest in generative art, 
		experimenting with new typography, or documenting my findings here on this blog. 
		Thanks for being part of the journey.
	</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 2rem;
		margin: 3rem 0;
	}
	.card h3 {
		margin-top: 0 !important;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}
	.card p {
		margin-bottom: 0 !important;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}
	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.about-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
